WEBVTT

00:07:28.756 --> 00:07:31.356
One being Equity for a Green New Deal.

00:07:31.716 --> 00:07:34.956
Pension divestment,
putting pressure on heels.

00:07:35.276 --> 00:07:38.076
Then I took lessons from Copwatch UK.

00:07:38.076 --> 00:07:40.916
Taught me my rights with police
arrests and interventions,

00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:43.036
discerning their intentions.

00:07:43.076 --> 00:07:46.596
I learned I have to think radically now.

00:07:47.676 --> 00:07:48.876
About strategy.

00:07:50.756 --> 00:07:52.276
And kindness.

00:07:53.316 --> 00:07:55.436
Kindness for myself

00:07:55.476 --> 00:07:57.276
and those right behind us.

00:07:57.356 --> 00:08:00.676
To be held by them and to hold right back.